  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>为《Spartan Weaponry》添加了以《暮色森林》为主题的新武器和特性。</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/GlDQfSnOeJX7W7o6HrI8dhqiRHiLNxoRnyYDvKZ0IpMRblDXHeOZkR5egxyJw8SW17M=w2400\" width=\"1536\" height=\"450\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>支持的材料：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>铁木</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>钢叶</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>骑士金属</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#0f0\"><strong>护甲伤害加成</strong></span>-&nbsp;对穿着护甲的敌人造成+2.0伤害</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>火焰</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#0f0\"><strong>烈焰</strong></span>- 使敌人燃烧15秒</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>计划中的更新：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">为1.19.2+版本添加1.12.2的纹理，以保持与暮色森林的一致性</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">将较新的功能移植回1.16.5版本</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在1.16.5+版本中作为地牢战利品添加武器</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"padding-left:240px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/U2ovAv5UMoA?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftinyurl.com%252fkreloxkinetic\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://1drv.ms/i/c/6bf544900f9867ae/IQR3yxNMtle9S4RxniPeeGgMAVrcnQ4U65DGA1uiSdBUIbE?width=837&height=80&n=-1\" width=\"837\" height=\"80\"> </a></p>",
